	(text "ESP32 + USB (U201): the processor, USB-C programming port, 3.3 V regulator, reset/boot and status LEDs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "93950bd5-85c7-5d54-877d-98d4e06a5de4")
	)
	(text_box "WHAT IT DOES\nU201, the ESP32-WROOM-32E module, runs the firmware: every other module talks to one of its pins (right side).\nUSB-C (J201) is the programming and configurator port. U203 protects its data lines from static,\nand U202 (CH340C) turns USB into the serial port of the ESP32 (UART0).\nQ201/Q202 let the PC reset the ESP32 and start it in boot mode, so flashing needs no button presses.\nUSB 5 V also feeds the board +5V through F201 and D201. U204 makes +3V3 from +5V for the whole board.\nThe RESET and BOOT buttons, the PWR and STATUS LEDs and the VIN_SENSE filter are here too."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 17.78 0)
		(size 168 36.8)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9fa472ec-0dbd-5653-ab1a-3ed8130fc029")
	)
	(text_box "PINS OF THIS MODULE (its block on the top sheet)\n+5V (in and out): the board 5 V: from the 5V buck module and from USB (through D201); feeds U204\n+3V3 (out): made here by U204 (AMS1117-3.3); supplies every other module\nGND: ground\nVIN_SENSE (in): GPIO36 (ADC): the supply voltage, divided by R101 (VIN input module) and R102 here\nIMU_INT (in): GPIO39: interrupt from the IMU module\nI2C_SDA, I2C_SCL (both ways): GPIO21, GPIO22: the I2C bus (RTC, EEPROM, IMU, ADC, GPS, Qwiic)\nRS485_TX, RS485_RX, RS485_DE (out, in, out): GPIO14, GPIO35, GPIO25: RS485 module (UART1)\nCAN_TX, CAN_RX (out, in): GPIO33, GPIO15: CAN module\nUART2_TX, UART2_RX (out, in): GPIO32, GPIO34: RS232 module (UART2)\nGPS_RXD, GPS_TXD, GPS_PPS (out, in, in): GPIO16 (to the GPS's RX), GPIO17 (from the GPS's TX), GPIO4: GPS + Qwiic module\nDIN1_IN_N, DIN2_IN_N (in): GPIO27, GPIO26: DIN inputs module (low = input active)\nDOUT1_CTRL (out): GPIO23: DOUT1 module (high = output on)\nEXP_IO18, EXP_IO19, EXP_IO5 (out): GPIO18, GPIO19, GPIO5: P1, P2 and USR LEDs (LEDs module)\nRTC_INT (in): GPIO13: RTC alarm (low = alarm)\nPower and ground reach the parts on this sheet only through these pins: the ground and supply symbols drawn on this sheet are local to it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 187.24 17.78 0)
		(size 216 36.8)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "83ad9a40-d9f6-50ad-a961-8b8064e1e1ae")
	)
